  "captions": {
    "voice-realm": [
      {
        "text": "讲大宪章，先别急着看那张羊皮纸。",
        "startMs": 100,
        "endMs": 2960,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "约翰是英格兰国王，家族却还在法国拥有大片领地。",
        "startMs": 3440,
        "endMs": 7140,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "1204年，他丢掉了诺曼底等重要地区。",
        "startMs": 7500,
        "endMs": 10480,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "他想夺回来，就得筹钱打仗。",
        "startMs": 10740,
        "endMs": 12960,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "海峡另一边的战争，逐渐变成了英格兰贵族身上的负担。",
        "startMs": 13200,
        "endMs": 16900,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "大宪章的起点，是这一场越来越难维持的权力与财政关系。",
        "startMs": 17620,
        "endMs": 22680,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-money": [
      {
        "text": "国王需要的钱，要从哪里来？",
        "startMs": 200,
        "endMs": 2440,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "贵族可以交钱代替出兵，继承、婚姻和监护也可能产生付款义务。",
        "startMs": 3320,
        "endMs": 8840,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "问题是，这些要求越来越重，战争又没有带来预期回报。",
        "startMs": 9740,
        "endMs": 14160,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "贵族担心的不只是口袋里的钱，还有家产和地位会不会被王权随意处置。",
        "startMs": 14720,
        "endMs": 20560,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "所以，他们要的是把国王也约束在可辨认的规则里。",
        "startMs": 21180,
        "endMs": 25220,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-church": [
      {
        "text": "桌边还有一股重要力量：教会。",
        "startMs": 100,
        "endMs": 2700,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "兰顿大主教参与协商，教会自身的自由也写进了宪章。",
        "startMs": 3420,
        "endMs": 7280,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "但本地大主教和罗马教皇，并不总是站在同一位置。",
        "startMs": 7620,
        "endMs": 11200,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6-p1",
          "run-0-c6-p2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "后来，约翰正是借助教皇的支持，推翻了这次安排。",
        "startMs": 11540,
        "endMs": 15060,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "记住这个区别，我们才看得懂：看似达成的和平，为什么很快又散了。",
        "startMs": 15360,
        "endMs": 20940,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-bouvines": [
      {
        "text": "1214年，约翰的夺地计划受到重创。",
        "startMs": 440,
        "endMs": 3180,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "布汶战役中，他的盟军败了；约翰本人在另一处，不能说他亲自在布汶战败。",
        "startMs": 3560,
        "endMs": 9000,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "军事失败没有消除筹款压力，反而让旧怨集中爆发。",
        "startMs": 9280,
        "endMs": 13540,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "到了1215年春，反叛贵族控制了伦敦。",
        "startMs": 13800,
        "endMs": 17080,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "双方手里都有武力，谁也不容易压倒谁，谈判就这样被推到了眼前。",
        "startMs": 17400,
        "endMs": 22980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-runnymede": [
      {
        "text": "1215年6月15日，双方在兰尼米德达成协议。",
        "startMs": 180,
        "endMs": 3820,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "先把它想成一份要止住内战的和约：约翰希望恢复服从，贵族要求把王权的边界写下来。",
        "startMs": 4320,
        "endMs": 11280,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它很重要，却没有一夜之间建立现代民主。",
        "startMs": 11480,
        "endMs": 14560,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "真正有意思的地方是，这场和平很快失败了，文书中的一些承诺却活了下来。",
        "startMs": 15080,
        "endMs": 21520,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15",
          "run-0-c16"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-seal": [],
    "voice-bargain": [
      {
        "text": "打开宪章，你会发现它谈的事情非常具体：继承、债务、婚姻、城市权利，还有森林制度。",
        "startMs": 120,
        "endMs": 7080,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "后世著名的大原则，最初往往藏在这些现实争端里。",
        "startMs": 7520,
        "endMs": 10880,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "接下来，我们抓住四个问题：国王怎样要钱，司法怎样约束权力，承诺保护谁，以及违约后谁来执行。",
        "startMs": 11400,
        "endMs": 21580,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-tax": [
      {
        "text": "先看钱。",
        "startMs": 240,
        "endMs": 920,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "第12条要求，征收某些兵役代役金和援助金，应当经过共同协商；它也保留了几类例外。",
        "startMs": 1400,
        "endMs": 7920,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c2-p1",
          "run-0-c2-p2",
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "那谁来协商呢？",
        "startMs": 8300,
        "endMs": 9200,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "主要是教会领袖、贵族和直接从国王那里领地的人。",
        "startMs": 9540,
        "endMs": 13240,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这里已经出现了征钱需要同意的要求，但距离一人一票、议会代表全体居民，还很远。",
        "startMs": 13480,
        "endMs": 19740,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-justice": [
      {
        "text": "最有名的是第39和第40条。",
        "startMs": 100,
        "endMs": 2080,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "国王不能任意拘捕、剥夺财产，也不能出卖、拒绝或拖延司法。",
        "startMs": 2500,
        "endMs": 7360,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "不过，原文说的自由人和同等身份者，都带着中世纪的含义，不能直接换成今天人人平等的公民和现代陪审团。",
        "startMs": 7700,
        "endMs": 17320,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "后世从这些话里发展出更广的原则，那是一段继续发生的历史。",
        "startMs": 17560,
        "endMs": 21780,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15",
          "run-0-c16"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-scope": [
      {
        "text": "那么，它只保护贵族吗？",
        "startMs": 340,
        "endMs": 2520,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "也不完全是。",
        "startMs": 3740,
        "endMs": 4560,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "城市、商人和一些自由土地持有者的利益，都出现在条文里。",
        "startMs": 5280,
        "endMs": 9720,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "寡妇也得到部分财产和再婚意愿的保护。",
        "startMs": 10200,
        "endMs": 13180,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "但大量非自由农民没有同等地位，女性的选择仍受领主权力限制。",
        "startMs": 13460,
        "endMs": 18600,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "看这份文书，要同时看到它减少了哪些侵害，又保留了哪些不平等。",
        "startMs": 18980,
        "endMs": 24340,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-security": [
      {
        "text": "承诺写下来了，谁来保证国王照做？",
        "startMs": 120,
        "endMs": 2900,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "保障条款交给25名贵族一项特殊权力：先提出违约，给国王40天纠正；如果仍不补救，就可以扣押城堡、土地和财产。",
        "startMs": 3260,
        "endMs": 13800,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这个设计很强硬，也很脆弱。",
        "startMs": 14180,
        "endMs": 16300,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "执行靠的还是贵族的力量，而不是一个稳定的独立裁判机构。",
        "startMs": 16620,
        "endMs": 20540,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15",
          "run-0-c16",
          "run-0-c17"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "写进文书，和真正执行，是两回事。",
        "startMs": 21140,
        "endMs": 24360,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c18"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-annulment": [
      {
        "text": "和平没有维持多久。",
        "startMs": 260,
        "endMs": 1460,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "1215年8月，约翰得到教皇的支持，教皇宣布宪章无效。",
        "startMs": 1980,
        "endMs": 7080,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这里不是约翰一个人把纸撕掉那么简单：教皇的权威，给了他反对协议的重要依据。",
        "startMs": 7560,
        "endMs": 13060,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "但贵族的不满不会因此消失。",
        "startMs": 13500,
        "endMs": 15760,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "共同的规则没能站稳，双方又回到武力较量。",
        "startMs": 16020,
        "endMs": 19300,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-war": [
      {
        "text": "贵族还做了一个今天听来意外的选择：邀请法国王子路易来争夺王位。",
        "startMs": 220,
        "endMs": 5980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "1216年，他带兵抵达，在伦敦被拥立，却没有加冕。",
        "startMs": 6680,
        "endMs": 10980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "反对约翰，并不等于反对君主制。",
        "startMs": 11380,
        "endMs": 14180,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "战争一直拖到1217年，林肯和桑威奇的失利，才让路易阵营走向和解。",
        "startMs": 14680,
        "endMs": 20360,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "宪章的命运，始终与力量的变化绑在一起。",
        "startMs": 20800,
        "endMs": 24200,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-john-death": [
      {
        "text": "1216年10月，约翰去世，九岁的亨利三世继位。",
        "startMs": 260,
        "endMs": 4340,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "战争并没有马上结束，但政治局面变了。",
        "startMs": 4800,
        "endMs": 7680,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "原先反对约翰的贵族，现在可以转而接受这个孩子。",
        "startMs": 8020,
        "endMs": 11780,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "摄政政府抓住机会：重新承诺一些自由，争取支持。",
        "startMs": 12080,
        "endMs": 15900,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "于是，原本限制国王的宪章，也成了王室重新站稳的工具。",
        "startMs": 16260,
        "endMs": 20780,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-reissue-1216": [
      {
        "text": "1216年11月，宪章第一次重新颁布。",
        "startMs": 240,
        "endMs": 3500,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "幼王还没有自己的大印，摄政者和教皇使节用印认证。",
        "startMs": 3860,
        "endMs": 8100,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "文本也变了，特别强硬的保障安排被去掉。",
        "startMs": 8500,
        "endMs": 11600,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "王室要保留能吸引支持的承诺，同时避免让宪章继续成为对抗王权的工具。",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 17680,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "文书活下来了，但已经不是原封不动的1215年版本。",
        "startMs": 18180,
        "endMs": 22420,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-reissue-1217": [
      {
        "text": "到了1217年，战争终于走向和解，宪章再次重颁。",
        "startMs": 220,
        "endMs": 4640,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它现在承担的新任务，是让一个刚经历内战的王国重新合作。",
        "startMs": 5000,
        "endMs": 9080,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "与此同时，森林事项另立一份宪章。",
        "startMs": 9440,
        "endMs": 12440,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "理解这两份文书，我们就能看到：限制权力，既关乎王位和贵族，也关乎土地与日常生活。",
        "startMs": 12840,
        "endMs": 20980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-forest": [
      {
        "text": "这里的森林，不一定就是密林。",
        "startMs": 80,
        "endMs": 2060,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它首先是一片受到王室特别管制的区域，里面还可能有牧地和村庄。",
        "startMs": 2380,
        "endMs": 7240,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "森林宪章处理这些规则怎样影响人们放牧、取用燃料和使用土地。",
        "startMs": 7760,
        "endMs": 13100,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7",
          "run-0-c8"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它在1217年独立颁布。",
        "startMs": 13300,
        "endMs": 15100,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c9"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "画面展示的是1225年重颁文本，日期要分清，不能拿后来的文书冒充最初那一份。",
        "startMs": 15360,
        "endMs": 22000,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c10",
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14",
          "run-0-c15"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-reissue-1225": [
      {
        "text": "1225年，亨利三世以自己的大印颁布新版本，换取一笔税收。",
        "startMs": 280,
        "endMs": 5400,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3",
          "run-0-c4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "后来长期发挥作用的文本，主要在这时定型。",
        "startMs": 5680,
        "endMs": 8720,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c5",
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "它保留许多承诺，也删改了原来的安排。",
        "startMs": 9100,
        "endMs": 11840,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c8",
          "run-0-c9",
          "run-0-c10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "你会发现一条反复出现的线索：国王需要钱，其他人便有机会要求确认权利。",
        "startMs": 12200,
        "endMs": 19240,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c11",
          "run-0-c12",
          "run-0-c13",
          "run-0-c14"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "宪章的生命，是在这种政治交换中延续的。",
        "startMs": 19900,
        "endMs": 23360,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c15",
          "run-0-c16",
          "run-0-c17"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "voice-statute": [
      {
        "text": "再往后看，1297年，爱德华一世确认宪章，修订后的文本进入官方成文法卷。",
        "startMs": 80,
        "endMs": 6900,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c1",
          "run-0-c2",
          "run-0-c3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "距离最初的协议，已经八十多年了。",
        "startMs": 7200,
        "endMs": 9780,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c4",
          "run-0-c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "原初和约失败，与后来的文本获得持久地位，并不冲突。",
        "startMs": 9980,
        "endMs": 13980,
        "timingKind": "observed",
        "sourceCueIds": [
          "run-0-c6",
          "run-0-c7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "正是这些重颁、确认和重新解释，把一场危机里的承诺，变成了可以不断援引的法律资源。",
